## Why This Is Asked
Tests architecture for intent resolution, safe routing, and token budgeting under real-world noise.

## Key Concepts
- Intent detection and confidence thresholds
- Template routing to data-extraction, summarization, code-generation
- Safety guards to prevent system-prompt leakage
- Token budgeting and edge-case handling

## Code Example
```typescript
type Template = 'data-extraction'|'summarization'|'code-generation';
type Payload = { template: Template; tokenBudget: number; justification: string; };
function routePrompt(prompt: string, signals: {intent?: string; confidence?: number;}): Payload {
  const t = (signals.intent === 'summarize' && (signals.confidence ?? 0) > 0.8) ? 'summarization'
            : (signals.intent === 'extract' && (signals.confidence ?? 0) > 0.8) ? 'data-extraction'
            : (signals.intent === 'generate' && (signals.confidence ?? 0) > 0.8) ? 'code-generation'
            : 'summarization';
  const budgets: Record<Template, number> = {'data-extraction': 800, 'summarization': 500, 'code-generation': 1200};
  return { template: t, tokenBudget: budgets[t], justification: 'inferred from signals with fallback' };
}
```

## Follow-up Questions
- How would you extend to n templates and multilingual prompts?
- How would you test guardrail effectiveness under prompt injections?

## Why This Is Asked

Assesses the ability to design intelligent, cost-aware routing systems for multi-module AI architectures in real-time environments, requiring consideration of performance trade-offs, safety constraints, and practical implementation details.

## Key Concepts

- Latency budgeting and real-time performance optimization
- Cost-aware routing and resource allocation
- Safety gating and data sensitivity handling
- Modular prompt orchestration and fallback mechanisms
- Policy-based decision making with precedence rules

## Code Example

```javascript
function routePrompt(prompt, signals) {
  const { budget, latency, safety, data_sensitivity } = signals;

  // Safety-first routing
  if (data_sensitivity > 0.7 || safety > 0.5) {
    return {
      module: 'SafetyGuard',
      plan: ['analyze_content', 'apply_filters', 'return_sanitized'],
      payload: { prompt, safety_score: safety, sensitivity_level: data_sensitivity }
    };
  }

  // Cost-optimized routing
  if (budget < 0.3 || latency < 100) {
    return {
      module: 'LightSummarizer',
      plan: ['extract_key_points', 'generate_summary'],
      payload: { prompt, max_tokens: 150 }
    };
  }

  // Default to comprehensive processing
  return {
    module: 'CitationEmbedder',
    plan: ['analyze_content', 'extract_citations', 'generate_embeddings'],
    payload: { prompt, include_sources: true }
  };
}
```

